Takei-senpai was different.

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:19.620
Takei-senpai didn't look at my chest.

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:23.370
The things that Takei-senpai would look at are...

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.800
Takei-senpai.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:38.590
Watase.

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:41.050
Today was the deadline, wasn't it?

00:18:43.680 --> 00:18:48.980
Why are you so committed to the club?

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:54.520
Even though you still visit the swimming school and have place to swim.

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:03.490
I like swimsuits.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:10.540
H-He really is weird after all...

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:14.840
I really liked that swimsuit.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:17.710
We all picked it out and chose it together.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:22.930
And we all worked hard thinking, "We'll go to races wearing these!"

00:19:23.850 --> 00:19:28.020
It's sad losing the motivation to wear them.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:34.820
Takei-senpai is the kind of person I thought he was after all.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:40.450
Senpai, do you remember talking about a race the other day?

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.870
That you would listen to whatever I would say if I won that race?

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.210
I wonder why she decided to race all of a sudden.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:02.300
They do say, "A woman's heart and the autumn sky."

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:03.340
Huh?

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.560
Sorry to keep everyone waiting.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:18.110
I'll beat you with all my power.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.610
I won't lose to anyone in the backstroke!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.990
hajikeru limited

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.990
About to burst; at my limit.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.240
It won't stop.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.200
These feelings continue as they are.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.790
Meguru-chan, boing!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:30.540
anywhere!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.330
What cup is that?

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.750
I've got plenty of confidence in my backstroke too.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.840
I can't see the dazzling future.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:43.300
Above the vague map.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:41.920
On your mark!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.510
Get set!

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:48.050
te wo nobashite mo fureru koto nai

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:48.050
Reach out your hand. Don't quiver.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.970
I won't lose.

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.810
somnambulism

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:50.970
I won't lose!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.850
Sometime or other!

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:56.150
I won't lose!!!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.400
Something or other!

00:20:57.150 --> 00:21:02.990
A miracle you'll bump into.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.860
Meguru-chan wins!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:05.410
I don't want lies!

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.120
About to burst; at my limit.

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:14.040
I want to tell you these unstoppable feelings just the way they are!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:12.160
Senpai, I'm sorry. I...

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:15.620
Thanks for swimming.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:19.590
Deliver and let it go! Smashed up!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:17.630
Senpai.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.460
I understand.

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.840
It's a promise so I'll listen to your request.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:24.090
Before everything withers, I'll break into pieces.

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:29.140
Put these feelings into a message now.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.720
You can do it, Meguru-chan!

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:34.350
Fly into the sky! Before you break.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.770
Do you have a competition swimsuit for me too?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.770
Where are you?

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:36.940
What?!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.730
Where are you going?

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:44.150
I can not find him anywhere

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.400
Yes!

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:41.020
We won't be disbanded!

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:43.860
And we can admire those boobs everyday!

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:49.030
I'm not lost!

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:53.500
I'm a sloppily singing siren.

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:53.500
Becoming your manager means you'll all be working hard!

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:58.380
The place where I finally reached with my fantasy is

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:56.370
Being our manager is completely different from-

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:58.210
Watase!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.040
somnambulism

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:01.380
Once my time improves, let's race again!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.050
sometime or other

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:10.930
I wonder when Takei-senpai will see me...

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:13.350
Everything is black and white

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:14.220
as a woman.

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:15.480
I don't want lies!

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:17.310
About to burst; at my limit.

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:24.280
It won't stop. These feelings continue as they are.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:29.870
I won't lose to anyone, I'll smash them up.

00:22:29.490 --> 00:22:34.200
Before everything withers, I'll break into pieces.

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:39.210
ima kono kimochi wo messeeji

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:39.210
Put these feelings into a message now.

00:22:38.960 --> 00:22:44.500
Before they explode and break me.

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:46.880
Where did you go?

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.800
Will you tell me?

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:54.510
I can not find him anywhere

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:01.650
About to burst; at my limit.

