I want to tell you these unstoppable feelings just the way they are!

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:14.120
Deliver and let it go! Smashed up!

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:18.540
Before everything withers, I'll break into pieces.

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.500
Put these feelings into a message now.

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:28.920
Fly into the sky! Before you break.

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:31.300
Where are you?

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:33.180
Where are you going?

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:38.560
I can not find him anywhere

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:40.850
Anywhere!

00:23:46.270 --> 00:23:49.070
We all decided to spend Christmas together.

00:23:49.490 --> 00:23:52.820
But I had a fight with Kusuda...

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:53.660
What?

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:55.410
You all can't come?

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.990
That means... it'll just be me and Kusuda?!
